OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed amid gas leak
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads have been closed while Jersey's
OL,7,Ffire service and Island Energy
OL,8,Finvestigate a gas leak.
OL,10,FSt Saviour's Hill has been shut at the
OL,11,Fjunction of Deloraine Road and St
OL,12,FSaviour's Hill, with 15 firefighters at
OL,13,Fthe scene.
OL,15,FTraffic travelling up St Saviour's Hill
OL,16,Fis being diverted via Chasse Brunette
OL,17,Fand vehicles travelling down St
OL,18,FSaviour's Hill will be stopped at Five
OL,19,FOaks and diverted via Bagatelle Road.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
