OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed amid gas leak
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closures are expected to remain
OL,7,Funtil late Thursday or Friday morning
OL,8,Fwhile repair work is carried out,
OL,9,FStates of Jersey Police said.
